---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vedolux 55 | Smokeless Heat">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 text-sm text-charcoal/60">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ember">Home</a> / <a href="/products" class="hover:text-ember">Products</a> / <a href="/products/wood-boilers" class="hover:text-ember">Wood Boilers</a> / <span>Vedolux 55</span>
    </div>
    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <img src="/images/products/Vedolux-55-1.jpg" alt="Vedolux 55" class="w-full max-w-sm border border-wood/10" />
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ember mb-2">Vedolux Fan Draft</p>
          <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood">Vedolux 55 - discontinued</h1>
          <div class="mt-4"><span class="text-2xl font-medium text-darkwood">$12,052.00</span></div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-charcoal/70">Wood Gasification Boiler with Induction Draft Fan</p>
          <a href="tel:8553890083" class="inline-block mt-6 bg-ember text-cream px-6 py-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide font-medium hover:bg-wood transition">Call to Order: 855-389-0083</a>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ember">Out of stock – discontinued</p>
          <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-wood/10 text-sm text-charcoal/70"><span class="mr-6"><strong>SKU:</strong> 6266</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-6">Description</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-darkwood">Wood Gasification Boiler with Induction Draft Fan</h3>
        <p><strong>Advantages of the Vedolux Models:</strong></p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
          <li>Gasification with help of a suction fan</li>
          <li>Accommodates 20" logs</li>
          <li>Simple boiler tube / flue pipe cleanout with complimentary brush</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Vedolux 55 boilers work through reverse combustion with the help of a suction fan. The suction fan creates the proper draft to combust firewood; therefore, the Vedolux can be installed with a chimney that does not meet height or width requirements for natural ventilation. To control unnecessary heat extraction, the fan stops automatically when the fire dies.</p>
        <p>The combustion chamber is over 21-1/2" deep and easily accepts wood up to 20" long. When properly used and maintained the Vedolux 55 boiler burn cycle outputs approximately 190 kBTU with 87% efficiency.</p>
        <p>The Vedolux 55 should be installed with an accumulator tank. A minimum of 660 gallons of storage or more is recommended. Boiler comes with an integral stand and ash drawer.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-4">Downloads</h2>
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <a href="/images/FullCatalogVarmebaronenWood.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Brochure (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Vedolux_55_170823_US.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Vedolux 55 Manual (PDF)</a>
        <a href="/images/Aqualux_Manual.pdf" target="_blank" class="block text-ember hover:underline">Aqualux Manual (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-8 border-t border-wood/10"><p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Legacy product. Contact Smokeless Heat for availability.</p></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
